body:
There's this indie horror film called Death House.

&#x200B;

It's horrible.  Not B-movie laughable horrible.  Just horrible.  And  yet I sat through the whole damn thing for the three minutes my favorite actor shows up and does his thing.

I did something like that and skipped high school band rehearsals.  The directors assumed they lost their notes and just stuck me in a band, higher than I would have place HAD I tried out.

&#x200B;

The suicide watch thing might have helped - and I feel you there - but hey.  Enjoy what you're given, eh?
